{"summary":"Get Hook'd on unhooking the hooks.","description":"\"Hook\" is a unique, relaxing logic puzzle game. \nIt has minimal graphics and beautiful sounds, that create calming atmosphere. \n\nYour goal is to remove all the hooks from the board by using various game mechanics that you'll discover along the way. \n\nMy game is designed to be played without any pressure or stress. There is no ads, no time restrictions or scores. So just chill and enjoy 69 puzzles while listening to a beautiful, relaxing music made by Wojciech Wasiak. \n\n- Minimalistic\n- Relaxing\n- Simple \n- Zen\n- Easy\n- No ads\n- Dark Mode\n- Cloud Saves\n- Great meditative, ambient soundtrack\n- 2 milion downloads worldwide","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JKaJZ0I_A4Y?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F-W1PPEfjd--1mhkVUBR1MgwkchUaKC0Nasg2b2zsahi21yAvH2VbIfaTQlOJidP8bvBNh6FmX216IkQnd6Y","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9qiCICsJoAyggJLe_KfxCKXLPFpgVTCZKIREE3Eu6rJLz-OmA0_QPA-ciGuqw-38WCQiGjJT9Utsry_4btjz","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xwmR3EN2gQ_NDDQZqNRkjQiRshNFA2sHcZkqrfqucftnENeLAC4dcJW3WLfnT_Z3QkAxpxj2NPMCn5QhPABOMNU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6Hn9QsGJUKOU88EMypu2peH5R_5qTsIb55a5C6ntwt3g1U9_T4XYUue0P8eIvK1AY1Z-fpiUVUN1Ct-RnLBUpw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1a9e6HRpHLQGM7mafOWVqch862ut0eAc2rSJPs2Wxfa72jtUq-vRuVk3dFCb_m3a2A8p53acj4jpGLGw54V2","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/72wSTF7ILfZZjb98yOz_OZGV6R3OeNSaODgbfzqvkPYysu3ilK2ABqIsg_QoNOKalYn5I_uJH6h_beLRAfFKOQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xLbs_SiPayu5S0W1fK8ONW1eMkyNFP0OZNnNoE82embcIqSCDEDC8QS5g0RXFhqrmOgmRSkObeq97SrsyvujBQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ITFjZoTIVR51miJuk3fOSLYy4cQw6XZES-7lSOZtSBc5uj10UdM2B8R4TpzudPNZwauExIYc0W_Hi9hePeY61w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3yOQG7RmjKrEHUEDm_5xIUTGiUp0hyw05P5ZYkQdZldNmF-Z_XgbPBV5NXxXPhfDxnpRccHPX81K